          "anchor": "return-value",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Return Value",
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "A dictionary object that describes the attributes (file, directory, symlink, and so on) of the file specified by ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "path",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": " (or ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "nil",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": " if an error occurred in Objective-C). The keys in the dictionary are described in ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "File Attribute Keys",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "content"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "anchor": "Discussion",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Discussion",
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "If the item at the path is a symbolic link\u2014that is, the value of the ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/FileAttributeKey/type",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " key in the attributes dictionary is ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/FileAttributeType/typeSymbolicLink",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": "\u2014you can use the ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/FileManager/destinationOfSymbolicLink(atPath:)",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " method to retrieve the path of the item pointed to by the link. You can also use the ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSString/resolvingSymlinksInPath",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " method of ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSString",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " to resolve links in the path before retrieving the item\u2019s attributes.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "As a convenience, ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " provides a set of methods (declared as a category on ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ") for quickly and efficiently obtaining attribute information from the returned dictionary: ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/fileGroupOwnerAccountName()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/fileModificationDate()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/fileOwnerAccountName()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/filePosixPermissions()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/fileSize()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/fileSystemFileNumber()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.foundation/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary/fileSystemNumber()",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": ", and ",
